      "description": "How a WHO SMART Guidelines L2 Digital Adaptation Kit is authored by a business analyst, a terminologist and a clinical SME under a programme manager. Each of the six authoring tracks calls l2-component-edit-review.bpmn (Process_L2ComponentEditReview): the agent edits, checks, renders and stages the component and hands it on, while a person in the component's reviewing role reviews it alongside, never as a gate. Each track's renderer, checker and reviewer are tabled in the skill l2-component-edit-review.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
